{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04762","headline":"奉酬韦祭酒嗣立偶游龙门北溪忽怀骊山别业呈诸留守之作 · 张说","name":"奉酬韦祭酒嗣立偶游龙门北溪忽怀骊山别业呈诸留守之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石涧泉虚落，松崖路曲回。\n闻君北溪下，想像南山隈。\n近念鼎湖别，遥思云嶂陪。\n不同奇觏往，空覩斯文来。\n岁後寒初变，春前芳未开。\n黄蕤嫋岸柳，紫蕚折村梅。\n尽室兹游玩，盈门几乐哉。\n嗟留洛阳陌，梦诣建章台。\n野失巢由性，朝非元凯才。\n布怀钦远迹，幽意日尘埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}